ers\">Careers</a></li>\n<li class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page\"><a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/faq/\" data-title=\"FAQ\">FAQ</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page\"><a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/news/\" data-title=\"News\">News</a></li>\n<li class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page\"><a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/events/\" data-title=\"Events\">Events</a></li>\n<li class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page\"><a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/contact/\" data-title=\"Contact\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n          \n          <div class=\"social\">\n\n                          <ul class=\"links\">\n\n                              \n                  <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontmaterials/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FRONT® Instagram\" class=\"instagram\"></a>\n                  </li>\n\n                                              \n                  <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontmaterials/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FRONT® Facebook\" class=\"facebook\"></a>\n                  </li>\n\n                                              \n                  <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://nl.pinterest.com/frontmaterials/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FRONT® Pinterest\" class=\"pinterest\"></a>\n                  </li>\n\n                                              \n                  <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontmaterials/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FRONT® Linkedin\" class=\"linkedin\"></a>\n                  </li>\n\n                                              \n                  <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEqvRyaEVVcz19KLnfBJNyA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FRONT® YouTube\" class=\"youtube\"></a>\n                  </li>\n\n                              \n              </ul>\n            \n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        \n        \n\n        \n        \n\n      </nav>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</header>\n\n    <div class=\"wrap\" role=\"document\">\n\n      <div class=\"content\">\n\n        <main class=\"main\" style=\"--main-color: 136, 136, 136\" >\n\n          \n\n<section class=\"project-hero-section \">\n\n  <div class=\"background-image\">\n    <picture>\n\n      \n        <source data-srcset=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6-390x478.jpg 390w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6-780x800.jpg 780w\" media=\"(max-width:390px)\">\n\n        \n      \n        <source data-srcset=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6-640x620.jpg 640w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6.jpg 1280w\" media=\"(max-width:640px)\">\n\n        \n      \n        <source data-srcset=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6-1024x620.jpg 1024w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6.jpg 2048w\" media=\"(max-width:1024px)\">\n\n        \n      \n        <source data-srcset=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6.jpg 1440w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6.jpg 1920w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6.jpg 2560w\" media=\"(min-width:1025px)\">\n\n        \n          <img data-sizes=\"auto\"\n               data-src=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-6-390x478.jpg\"\n               \n               alt=\"StoneCycling || Urban Mining &amp; Dry Stacking Bricks in Switzerland\"\n               class=\"lazyload \"\n               decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" fetch-priority=\"auto\">\n\n        \n      \n    </picture>\n\n  \n\n    <div class=\"container title-container\">\n\n      <h1>Urban Mining &amp; Dry Stacking Bricks in Switzerland</h1>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\n      <div class=\"intro-text\">\n        <h2>Urban Mining</h2>\n        <div class=\"text\"><p><strong>Together with Werner Sobek (architect), Dirk E. Hebel and Felix Heisel, FRONT® (formerly StoneCycling) developed a brick specially designed for dry stacking and disassembly as part of the UMAR project. </strong></p>\n<p>The Urban Mining and Recycling (UMAR) Experimental Unit is one of the units at the NEST research building on the Swiss Federal Laboratories for Materials Science and Technology (EMPA) campus in Dübendorf, Switzerland.</p>\n<p>The building design demonstrates how a responsible approach to dealing with our natural resources can go hand in hand with appealing architectural forms. The project is underpinned by the proposition that all the resources required to construct a building must be fully reusable, recyclable or compostable.</p>\n</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"specifications\">\n        <dl>\n\n                      <div>\n              <dt>Location</dt>\n              <dd>Dübendorf, Switzerland</dd>\n            </div>\n          \n                      <div>\n              <dt></dt>\n              <dd>Educational</dd>\n            </div>\n          \n                    <div>\n            <dt>Client</dt>\n            <dd>\n                                                <a class=\"\" href=\"http://nest-umar.net/portfolio/waste-based-brick/\" target=\"_blank\">Urban Mining and Recycling (UMAR) Experimental Unit</a>\n                                          </dd>\n          </div>\n          \n                    <div>\n            <dt>Design</dt>\n            <dd>\n                                                <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/werner-sobek/\" target=\"_blank\">Werner Sobek</a><span class=\"separator\">, </span>\n                                                                <a class=\"\" href=\"https://fcl.ethz.ch/people/Module-Lead/DirkHebel.html\" target=\"_blank\">Dirk E. Hebel</a><span class=\"separator\">, </span>\n                                                                <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/felix-heisel/\" target=\"_blank\">Felix Heisel</a>\n                                          </dd>\n          </div>\n          \n          \n                    <div>\n            <dt>Application</dt>\n            <dd>\n                              <a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/projects/?applications=interior-walls\">Interior Walls</a>\n                          </dd>\n          </div>\n          \n          \n                                    <div class=\"custom\">\n                <dt>Status</dt>\n                <dd><p>Completed, 2018</p>\n</dd>\n              </div>\n                      \n          \n\n        </dl>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n    <div class=\"impact\">\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\n      <div class=\"info\">\n\n        <h2>Impact</h2>\n        <span class=\"label\">Waste upcycled with this project</span>\n        <span class=\"amount\">4,520 kg</span>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n  \n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"image-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <figure class=\"image\">\n\n      <img\n      data-sizes=\"auto\"\n      data-src=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1.jpg\"\n      data-srcset=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1.jpg 1768w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1.jpg 1456w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1.jpg 1286w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1-944x629.jpg 944w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1-720x480.jpg 720w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1-588x392.jpg 588w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1-517x345.jpg 517w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1-375x250.jpg 375w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1-327x218.jpg 327w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-1-272x181.jpg 272w\"\n      \n      alt=\"StoneCycling || Urban Mining &amp; Dry Stacking Bricks in Switzerland\"\n      class=\"lazyload \"\n      decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" fetch-priority=\"auto\">\n\n  \n\n      <figcaption>Image credit: Zooey Braun</figcaption>\n\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n  \n    <section class=\"paragraph-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <div class=\"text\">\n\n      <h3><strong>Custom WasteBasedBricks</strong></h3>\n<p>For this project, we developed a one-of-a-kind variation on the WasteBasedBrick using the <a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/products/wastebasedbricks-mushroom/\">Mushroom </a>as the basis. We changed the recipe slightly to make the bricks fit better with the interior.</p>\n<p>The idea was to create different colours and textures using one single brick. To do this, we worked with several finishes, such as <a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/products/wastebasedbricks-mushroom/?texture=punched\">Punched</a>, <a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/products/wastebasedbricks-mushroom/?texture=sliced\">Sliced</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.front-materials.com/products/wastebasedbricks-mushroom/?texture=raw\">Raw</a> &#8211; and even polished a few!</p>\n\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n  \n    <section class=\"two-images-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <figure class=\"image image-left\">\n\n      <img\n      data-sizes=\"auto\"\n      data-src=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1.jpg\"\n      data-srcset=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1.jpg 1768w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1.jpg 1456w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1.jpg 1286w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1-944x944.jpg 944w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1-720x720.jpg 720w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1-588x588.jpg 588w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1-517x517.jpg 517w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1-375x375.jpg 375w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1-327x327.jpg 327w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-5-1-272x272.jpg 272w\"\n      \n      alt=\"StoneCycling || Urban Mining &amp; Dry Stacking Bricks in Switzerland\"\n      class=\"lazyload \"\n      decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" fetch-priority=\"auto\">\n\n  \n\n      <figcaption>Using different finishes of the same brick to create an exciting surface</figcaption>\n\n    </figure>\n\n    <figure class=\"image image-right\">\n\n      <img\n      data-sizes=\"auto\"\n      data-src=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4.jpg\"\n      data-srcset=\"https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4.jpg 1768w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4.jpg 1456w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4.jpg 1286w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4-944x944.jpg 944w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4-720x720.jpg 720w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4-588x588.jpg 588w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4-517x517.jpg 517w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4-375x375.jpg 375w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4-327x327.jpg 327w, https://www.front-materials.com/app/uploads/2018/02/urban-mining-dry-stacking-bricks-switzerland-stonecycling-mushroom-4-272x272.jpg 272w\"\n      \n      alt=\"StoneCycling || Urban Mining &amp; Dry Stacking Bricks in Switzerland\"\n      class=\"lazyload \"\n      decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" fetch-priority=\"auto\">\n\n  \n\n      <figcaption></figcaption>\n\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n  \n    <section class=\"paragraph-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <div class=\"text\">\n\n      <h3><strong>Life Cycle Thinking</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Urban Mining is, in short, the process of reclaiming compounds and elements from products, buildings and waste.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Life cycle thinking is placed at the forefront of the design: Instead of merely using and subsequently disposing of resources, they are borrowed from their technical and biological cycles for a certain amount of time before being put back into circulation once again.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Such an approach makes reusing and repurposing materials equally important to recycling and upcycling (both at a systemic and molecular/biological level, e.g. via melting or composting).</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This conceptual emphasis means that UMAR functions simultaneously as a material laboratory and temporary material storage.</span></p>\n\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n  \n    <section class=\"image-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <figure class=\"image\">\n\n      <img\n      data-sizes=\"auto\"\n      data-src=\"https://www.front-materials.co