tps://www.mozilla.org/de/firefox/new/\">Firefox.</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://zirkular.net/en/navigation/\" class=\"hamburger inactive \">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"line line_1\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"line line_2\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"line line_3\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"line line_4\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"line line_5\"></span>\n\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</header> <!-- End Header -->\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"sticky_logo home_logo_white\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"https://zirkular.net/wp-content/themes/zirkular/images/logo_white.svg\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t<main>\n\t<div class=\"detail_page page_projekte_detail\" data-barba=\"container\" data-barba-namespace=\"projekte_detail\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"page_header\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://zirkular.net/en/\" class=\"go_home\">\n\t\t\t\tZirkular\n\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://zirkular.net/en/projects/\" class=\"go_to_projects\">\n\t\t\t\tProjects\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<h1>\n\t\t\t\tLysP8\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<a class=\"next_slide\"></a>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"swiper\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide project_text\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inside_project_text\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"scrollbar_text\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"project_text wysiwig_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In the planned new building, an ambitious reuse strategy has been developed together with the project team, which should save around 250 tons of CO2eq. One focus is on the façade, which was designed almost entirely from used components such as roof tiles, window shutters, fiber cement panels and railings. Another focal point is the interior ceilings, which, despite strict standard requirements, are to be consistently implemented using reused, recycled and biogenic materials. A major coup was scored early in the preliminary project stage, when all the kitchens needed for the project were dismantled from a housing estate in Zurich and stored for this specific purpose.</p>\n<p>LysP8 is part of HEIG-VD&#8217;s LCA research project, where all measures are to be documented and evaluated in terms of their emission savings.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Project Text -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"project_services wysiwig_content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"small_type\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmandate\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Small Type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://zirkular.net/en/service/#component-hunting\" class=\"button_link\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcomponent hunting\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://zirkular.net/en/service/#specialist-planning\" class=\"button_link\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tspecialist planning\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Project Services -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"project_kontext wysiwig_content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"small_type\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcontext\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Small Type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kontext_row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"column_left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tyear of completion:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Colum Left -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"column_right\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2025\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Colum Right -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Kontext Row -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kontext_row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"column_left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tproject team:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Colum Left -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"column_right\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPascal Hentschel, Andreas Oefner\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div> <!-- End Colum Right -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\