45613704/wiewiorra-plattenpalast-01.jpg\">\n                      <img src=\"https://www.upcyclingarchitecture.it/media/pages/items/plattenpalast/0096c6d911-1745613705/wiewiorra-plattenpalast-02.jpg\">\n                  </div>\n    <div class=\"second\">\n              <section class=\"mb-5\">\n          <h6 class=\"mb-2 pb-2\">Details:</h6>\n          <div class=\"block-sans-s\"><p><strong>Location: </strong>Berlin, Germany<br><strong>Year: </strong>2009<br><strong>Design Team: </strong>Carsten Wiewiorra<br><strong>Team: </strong>Shell construction: Anna Krüger, Claus Asam, Claudia Westermann-Stubenazi, Jan Kindereit; Expansion: Anna Tscherch<br><strong>Program: </strong>Art Gallery/Residential<strong><br>Reuse info: <br></strong>WBS 70 panels used: 13 parts<br>Windows: 12 panes with aluminum frames from the Palace of the Republic</p></div>\n        </section>\n              <section class=\"mb-5\">\n          <h6 class=\"mb-2 pb-2\"></h6>\n          <div class=\"block-sans-s\"></div>\n        </section>\n              <section class=\"mb-5\">\n          <h6 class=\"mb-2 pb-2\">Link:</h6>\n          <div class=\"block-sans-s\"><p><a href=\"https://wwstudio.de/\" target=\"_blank\">wiewiorra studio website</a><br><a href=\"https://wwstudio.de/projects/plattenpalst\" target=\"_blank\">plattenpalast project website</a><br><a href=\"https://wwstudio.de/projects/minimalwohnen-im-plattenpalast\" target=\"_blank\">plattenpalast - living in Minimal Space</a></p></div>\n        </section>\n                </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-none d-md-block\" style=\"margin-top: -1px;\" data-comment=\"fix-border\"></div>\n\n\n<script src=\"https://www.upcyclingarchitecture.it/assets/js/common.js?v=0.0.12\"></script>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <img class=\"footer-logo\" src=\"https://www.upcyclingarchitecture.it/assets/images/logo-color.svg\" alt=\"Logo color\" />\n   