oduction/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=650&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 650w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=768&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 768w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=1024&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1024w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=1280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1280w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=1536&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1536w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=2048&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2048w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=2560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2560w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/9743dcddfd6b672f186fb8f0ac209268c9ae86cf-9050x5656.jpg?w=3072&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 3072w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full transition-opacity duration-500 object-cover\"/></div></div></div><div data-hero-content=\"true\" class=\"relative min-h-screen-s pb-100 text-white pt-24\" style=\"background-color:#ff653b;z-index:1\"><div class=\"px-main gap-grid md:grid-main md:gap-y-50\"><div class=\"md:col-span-6 md:row-start-1 relative z-[2]\"><div><h1 class=\"type-h1\" style=\"color:white\">PLP Architecture HQ</h1><p class=\"type-h1 text-white/50\" style=\"color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)\">London, UK</p></div></div><p class=\"type-h1 mt-20 md:mt-0 md:col-span-12 md:col-start-7 md:row-start-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.3s ease-out\">PLP Architecture’s new London studio is a working model for circular design, where 92% of materials are reused or donated and a further 7% recycled, diverting 175.78 tonnes of CO₂ from landfill.</p><div class=\"mt-36 md:mt-0 md:col-span-6 md:row-start-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.3s ease-out\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-y-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-grid type-s1\"><div>Client</div><div class=\"col-span-2\">PLP Architecture</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-grid type-s1\"><div>Team</div><div class=\"col-span-2\"><p class=\"text-pretty\">Contractor<br/><span class=\"opacity-50\">Method<br/></span>Joinery<br/><span class=\"opacity-50\">Contrax Furniture</span><br/>Terrazzo Feature<br/><span class=\"opacity-50\">Solus</span><br/>Reclaimed Marble<br/><span class=\"opacity-50\">Grants of Shoreditch</span><br/><br/></p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-grid type-s1\"><div>Typology</div><div class=\"col-span-2\"><span><a class=\"inline-block block font-normal items-baseline  hover-timing transition-opacity hover:opacity-50 type-s1 underline !opacity-100 !transition-colors link-underline\" href=\"/projects?typology=office-headquarters\">Office + Headquarters</a></span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-grid type-s1\"><div>Status</div><div class=\"col-span-2\">● Completed</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-grid type-s1\"><div>Share</div><div class=\"col-span-2\"><span><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-block block font-normal items-baseline  hover-timing transition-opacity hover:opacity-50 type-s1 underline !opacity-100 !transition-colors link-underline\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=\">Facebook</a>, </span><span><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-block block font-normal items-baseline  hover-timing transition-opacity hover:opacity-50 type-s1 underline !opacity-100 !transition-colors link-underline\" href=\"https://x.com/intent/tweet?url=&amp;text=PLP%20Architecture%20HQ\">X</a>, </span><span><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-block block font-normal items-baseline  hover-timing transition-opacity hover:opacity-50 type-s1 underline !opacity-100 !transition-colors link-underline\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=\">LinkedIn</a>, </span><span><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-block block font-normal items-baseline  hover-timing transition-opacity hover:opacity-50 type-s1 underline !opacity-100 !transition-colors link-underline\" href=\"https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=\">Pinterest</a>, </span><span><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-block block font-normal items-baseline  hover-timing transition-opacity hover:opacity-50 type-s1 underline !opacity-100 !transition-colors link-underline\" href=\"https://wa.me/?text=PLP%20Architecture%20HQ%20\">WhatsApp</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-20\"><button class=\"inline-block items-center text-center justify-center hover-timing transition-colors font-medium border border-white/50 text-white/50 hover:border-white hover:text-black hover:bg-white py-4 px-7 md:px-10 md:py-12 tracking-[-.01em] md:tracking-0 text-13 md:text-14 leading-120 rounded-[3px]\">View Gallery</button></div></div><div class=\"mt-30 md:mt-0 md:col-span-12 md:col-start-7 md:row-start-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.3s ease-out\"><h2 class=\"type-s1 mb-8 md:mb-24\">About</h2><div class=\"type-p2\"><p class=\"my-[0.75em] first:mt-0 last:mb-0 text-pretty\">PLP Architecture’s new London studio at The White Chapel Building is a powerful statement of intent, a working embodiment of the practice’s core values of innovation, sustainability and collaboration. Delivered through a circular fit-out strategy, the 22,850 sq ft space demonstrates a bold new approach to workplace design: one that places people, planet and practicality at the heart of decision-making.</p><p class=\"my-[0.75em] first:mt-0 last:mb-0 text-pretty\">Unlike conventional fit-outs that start from scratch, PLP’s approach began with what already existed. Every opportunity to reuse, repurpose and extend the life of materials was evaluated. By integrating elements from both their former and new spaces, the team achieved a 75.4% reduction in embodied carbon. 92% of materials from the previous studio were either reused or donated, with a further 7% recycled, saving 175.78 tonnes of CO₂ from landfill.</p><p class=\"my-[0.75em] first:mt-0 last:mb-0 text-pretty\">And this was delivered for just £64 per square foot, 68% less than the cost of a typical London fit-out. Highlights include terrazzo worktops embedded with architectural samples, repurposed marble transformed into new tables, and furniture either restored or rehomed. The result is a vibrant, low-impact, and deeply intentional space. One that reflects PLP’s belief in architecture’s power to drive positive change.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"px-main p-24 flex items-center gap-x-10\"><a class=\"inline-block block font-normal items-baseline  hover-timing transition-opacity opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 type-p1\" href=\"/projects\">Projects</a><svg width=\"10\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 7\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M6.86992 7H5.54123L5.52846 6.972L8.30081 4.004H0V2.996H8.30081L5.52846 0.0279996L5.54123 0H6.86992L10 3.486V3.514L6.86992 7Z\" fill=\"black\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\"></path></svg><span class=\"type-p1\">PLP Architecture HQ</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-24 pb-8 md:pb-24\"><div class=\"px-main\"><div><div class=\"w-full\" style=\"aspect-ratio:2.3333333333333335\"><div class=\"relative overflow-clip h-full w-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?fit=max&amp;auto=format\" srcSet=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=50&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 50w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=100&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 100w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=250&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 250w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=650&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 650w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=768&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 768w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=1024&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1024w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=1280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1280w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=1536&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1536w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=2048&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2048w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=2560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2560w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/135913dd4f4f76b482c34908571fcfe2d0e515d4-2000x857.jpg?w=3072&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 3072w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full transition-opacity duration-500 object-cover\"/></div></div><div class=\"pt-8 md:pt-16 grid-main gap-grid\"><p class=\"type-p1 col-span-7\">By rethinking value and designing with intention, we’ve created a space that reflects our ethos, and set a model others can follow to achieve more with less.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"px-main\"><div><div class=\"w-full\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.7777777777777777\"><div class=\"relative overflow-clip h-full w-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?fit=max&amp;auto=format\" srcSet=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=50&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 50w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=100&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 100w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=250&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 250w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=650&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 650w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=768&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 768w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=1024&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1024w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=1280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1280w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=1536&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1536w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=2048&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2048w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=2560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2560w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/c53ec0be71a998f49dba5306b32e5834e42834f3-2000x1125.jpg?w=3072&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 3072w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full transition-opacity duration-500 object-cover\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"px-main\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-grid mb-64 md:mb-0\"><div><div style=\"aspect-ratio:0.75\"><div class=\"relative overflow-clip h-full w-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?fit=max&amp;auto=format\" srcSet=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=50&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 50w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=100&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 100w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=250&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 250w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=650&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 650w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=768&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 768w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=1024&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1024w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=1280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1280w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=1536&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1536w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=2048&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2048w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=2560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2560w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/84ed9091f00dfd29ba24aa0c12cc213531289774-1500x2000.jpg?w=3072&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 3072w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full transition-opacity duration-500 object-cover\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"md:order-first\"><div class=\"md:grid md:grid-cols-9 md:gap-grid\"><h2 class=\"type-h2 pr-16 md:col-span-4 mb-8 md:mb-0\">Even new items took a circular approach.</h2><div class=\"type-p1 pr-30 md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"my-[0.75em] first:mt-0 last:mb-0 text-pretty\">While we prioritised reuse and upcycling in our studio fit-out, expanding into a larger space meant that some new furniture was necessary – particularly for our meeting rooms. Even in these choices, we remained committed to circular design principles, selecting materials that aligned with our focus on sustainability and resource-conscious design.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"px-main\"><div class=\" pb-80\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/9]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-clip w-full h-full object-cover\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?fit=max&amp;auto=format\" srcSet=\"https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=50&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 50w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=100&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 100w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=250&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 250w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=650&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 650w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=768&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 768w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=1024&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1024w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=1280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1280w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=1536&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1536w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=2048&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2048w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=2560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2560w,https://assets.plparchitecture.com/images/x91j7tbn/production/e1e42f9e732c435037a7f9d62a7d3dd0a6036bec-2000x1125.jpg?w=3072&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 3072w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full transition-opacity duration-500 object-cover\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-grid gap-y-12 m