mp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Faa9144319ecb7224c4f7ffab239a9aec74a1dc3b-3332x4998.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Faa9144319ecb7224c4f7ffab239a9aec74a1dc3b-3332x4998.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Faa9144319ecb7224c4f7ffab239a9aec74a1dc3b-3332x4998.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\" absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center group md:opacity-0 hover:opacity-100 duration-300 z-10 cursor-pointer\"><button data-active=\"false\" class=\"pointer-events-none !leading-none uppercase rounded-[40px] border transition-colors duration-200 inline-block text-12 md:text-16 py-[0.2rem] px-[0.5rem] text-white border  hover:bg-white hover:text-black hover:border-white data-[active=true]:bg-white data-[active=true]:text-black data-[active=true]:border-white cursor-pointer\">Show image</button></div></span></div><figcaption class=\"italic text-12 mt-2 [&amp;_mark]:text-primary [&amp;_mark]:bg-transparent\">Copyright: Samuel Causse</figcaption></figure><h3>Designer: <a text=\"Anna Søgaard\" markType=\"link\" markKey=\"5c0cb4c405ab\" class=\"underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.annasoegaard.dk/\">Anna Søgaard</a></h3><p><em>Table Supports</em><br/>Inspired by traditional carpenter trestles, Anna Søgaard designed flexible, stackable table supports made from maple and beech from Svanninge Bjerge. The top of the trestle is shaped as an I-profile for strength and stability. The three-leg design saves material and weight while providing extra seating space. All elements are dimensionally uniform, assembled with countersunk screws, and feature a small saddle connecting leg to beam. When not in use, the trestles can be stacked to form a sculptural installation, combining functionality, sustainability, and a connection to nature.</p><figure class=\"my-12 md:my-20\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-0\" style=\"padding-bottom:149.98662028364998%\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block\"><img class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center\" src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/o0gogd4q/production/c185193a604c450284632ae92d91d8fb9f787fbc-3737x5605.jpg?w=20&amp;blur=20&amp;q=20&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format\"/><img alt=\"{{}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" sizes=\"1500px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Fc185193a604c450284632ae92d91d8fb9f787fbc-3737x5605.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Fc185193a604c450284632ae92d91d8fb9f787fbc-3737x5605.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Fc185193a604c450284632ae92d91d8fb9f787fbc-3737x5605.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Fc185193a604c450284632ae92d91d8fb9f787fbc-3737x5605.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fo0gogd4q%2Fproduction%2Fc185193a604c450284632ae92d91d8fb9f787fbc-3737x5605.jpg%3Fw%3D200%26blur%3D320%26q%3D80%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io