ral rubber and animal brushes) with a wool cover. The cover is constructed as an envelope that folds around the Hairlock cushion, avoiding seams and zippers. To prevent sliding, a magnetic\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Furniture\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"image\\\",\\\"asset\\\":{\\\"_createdAt\\\":\\\"2025-04-10T08:56:00Z\\\",\\\"_id\\\":\\\"image-36dbda065146ae08bf4097d0f1c8fdf59eb3e2c6-1920x2560-jpg\\\",\\\"_rev\\\":\\\"i0F12A6zSC3OBmoGP0vAzl\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imageAsset\\\",\\\"_updatedAt\\\":\\\"2025-07-31T11:52:37Z\\\",\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Skammel af træ\\\",\\\"assetId\\\":\\\"36dbda065146ae08bf4097d0f1c8fdf59eb3e2c6\\\",\\\"creditLine\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":null,\\\"extension\\\":\\\"jpg\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imageMetadata\\\",\\\"blurHash\\\":\\\"dJEybw~p%g.7%#xt%L%ME3RjnOoeM{odRjf6xtofNHbH\\\",\\\"dimensions\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imageDimensions\\\",\\\"aspectRatio\\\":0.75,\\\"height\\\":2560,\\\"width\\\":1920},\\\"hasAlpha\\\":false,\\\"isOpaque\\\":true,\\\"lqip\\\":\\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\\\",\\\"palette\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePalette\\\",\\\"darkMuted\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#655132\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#fff\\\",\\\"population\\\":2.55,\\\"title\\\":\\\"#fff\\\"},\\\"darkVibrant\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#45371a\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#fff\\\",\\\"population\\\":0.35,\\\"title\\\":\\\"#fff\\\"},\\\"dominant\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#cbcfba\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#000\\\",\\\"population\\\":7.5,\\\"title\\\":\\\"#000\\\"},\\\"lightMuted\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#cbcfba\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#000\\\",\\\"population\\\":7.5,\\\"title\\\":\\\"#000\\\"},\\\"lightVibrant\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#eedcbc\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#000\\\",\\\"population\\\":0.48,\\\"title\\\":\\\"#000\\\"},\\\"muted\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#9c8763\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#fff\\\",\\\"population\\\":3.31,\\\"title\\\":\\\"#fff\\\"},\\\"vibrant\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#bc946c\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#000\\\",\\\"population\\\":0,\\\"title\\\":\\\"#fff\\\"}}},\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\",\\\"opt\\\":{\\\"media\\\":{\\\"tags\\\":null}},\\\"originalFilename\\\":\\\"Hampus_Berndtson_Møbler_06_FotoHB_low.jpg\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"images/o0gogd4q/production/36dbda065146ae08bf4097d0f1c8fdf59eb3e2c6-1920x2560.jpg\\\",\\\"sha1hash\\\":\\\"36dbda065146ae08bf4097d0f1c8fdf59eb3e2c6\\\",\\\"size\\\":1458485,\\\"title\\\":null,\\\"uploadId\\\":\\\"95GhAE1tJiIgT5qS2uA3FOIUTNkkHgZo\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/o0gogd4q/production/36dbda065146ae08bf4097d0f1c8fdf59eb3e2c6-1920x2560.jpg\\\"}}},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"d88aa954aa22\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"c018791b1fcd\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"0afaf816091b\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Signage\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"h3\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"93bacf58349e\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"1eaa0042ac52\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"The building’s wayfinding and signage program has also been designed with reusability and sustainability in mind. Self-adhesive film has been used for the large facade signs as well as for glass surfaces both inside and outside the building. This makes it easy to update text and logos without replacing the signs themselves. The light boxes on the facade are made from recycled plastic and aluminum.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"},{\\