>\r\n                                    <img class=\"image-item\" src=\"\" alt=\"\" />\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-image-caption-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-image-caption body-text--small\">\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-buttons\" x-ref=\"modalSwiperButtons\">\r\n                                        <button class=\"gallery-block__swiper-button--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">\r\n                                            \r\n<svg width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 41.8768L31.716 17.9292L7.94982 41.6954L1.05581 34.8014Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                        <button class=\"gallery-block__swiper-button--next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">\r\n                                            \r\n<svg width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 41.8768L31.716 17.9292L7.94982 41.6954L1.05581 34.8014Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar\" x-ref=\"modalSidebar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-buttons\">\r\n                                <button class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-button--info\" aria-label=\"Info\">\r\n                                    <svg width=\"4\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 4 17\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 17H0V7H4V17Z\" />\r\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 4H0V0H4V4Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                </button>\r\n                                <button class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-button--close d-none\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n                                    \r\n<svg width=\"17\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <g id=\"plusExplore\">\r\n        <rect id=\"barH\" y=\"8\" width=\"17\" height=\"3\" />\r\n        <rect id=\"barV\" x=\"7\" y=\"11\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" transform=\"rotate(-90 7 11)\" />\r\n    </g>\r\n</svg>\r\n                                </button>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-text\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"umb-block-grid__layout-item\" data-content-element-type-alias=\"richTextEditor\" data-content-element-type-key=\"c1027a81-3465-402a-bde1-ed4090557084\" data-element-udi=\"umb://element/42d9bd072fe6426caa4a50c687612237\" data-col-span=\"8\" data-row-span=\"1\" style=\" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 8; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; \">\r\n\r\n<p>&lsquo;We shouldn&rsquo;t waste things,&rsquo; insists Clive Nichol, founder and CEO of Fabrix which invests in and develops buildings. Two of the company&rsquo;s London projects reuse steel to adapt old buildings: at Roots in the Sky with Sheppard Robson, a transformation of old Blackfriars Crown Court, it will support the plant floors, and at 55 Great Suffolk Street it will make up the structure for a new external core designed by Hawkins\\Brown.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Where to start?</strong><br />\nHow does a project bring in reused steel? First it needs the will of those holding the purse strings. Nichol, who does that here, explains. &lsquo;In a project meeting, we saw we were breaking down the levels of embodied carbon. Steel was such a high polluter, but how could we bring down the carbon? In previous projects we had exposed old structures. So I asked the team: &ldquo;Why don&rsquo;t we reuse some steel?&rdquo;.&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>The first hard barrier on a project like Roots in the Sky is that the project team is running to stages and deadlines, he continues, which drives them down a funnel. Even when those involved know there are better ways to do things, he says, it can be hard to change course.</p>\n\n<p>But this time the team put out feelers to demolition contractors, stating the steel sizes they needed. It was structural engineer AKTII that came up with the steel, mined from its project at 1 Broadgate in the City. Demolition contractor Cantillon had already bought the steel, planning to melt down and recycle it. It had already removed the concrete casings and hot-cut it at each end.</p>    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"umb-block-grid__layout-item\" data-content-element-type-alias=\"galleryBlock\" data-content-element-type-key=\"4840a772-2227-467d-8e08-80cf13434971\" data-element-udi=\"umb://element/415f5f4e99bc41c0895d7ec6a4c35d93\" data-col-span=\"8\" data-row-span=\"1\" style=\" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 8; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; \">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gallery-block block-background--black\" x-load x-ignore x-data=\"galleryBlock\">\r\n    <div class=\"gallery-block__swiper swiper\" x-ref=\"swiperEl\">\r\n        <div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-wrapper swiper-wrapper\" x-ref=\"swiperWrapper\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-slide swiper-slide\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-none slide-text-hidden\">\r\n     