"17\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <g id=\"plusWork\">\r\n        <rect id=\"barH\" y=\"8\" width=\"17\" height=\"3\" />\r\n        <rect id=\"barV\" x=\"7\" y=\"18\" width=\"17\" height=\"3\" transform=\"rotate(-90 7 18)\" />\r\n    </g>\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                        <button class=\"d-none disabled gallery-block__modal-button--zoom-out\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\">\r\n                                            \r\n<svg width=\"17\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <g id=\"plusExplore\">\r\n        <rect id=\"barH\" y=\"8\" width=\"17\" height=\"3\" />\r\n        <rect id=\"barV\" x=\"7\" y=\"11\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" transform=\"rotate(-90 7 11)\" />\r\n    </g>\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <img class=\"image-item\" src=\"\" alt=\"\" />\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-image-caption-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-image-caption body-text--small\">\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-buttons\" x-ref=\"modalSwiperButtons\">\r\n                                        <button class=\"gallery-block__swiper-button--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">\r\n                                            \r\n<svg width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 41.8768L31.716 17.9292L7.94982 41.6954L1.05581 34.8014Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                        <button class=\"gallery-block__swiper-button--next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">\r\n                                            \r\n<svg width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 41.8768L31.716 17.9292L7.94982 41.6954L1.05581 34.8014Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar\" x-ref=\"modalSidebar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-buttons\">\r\n                                <button class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-button--info\" aria-label=\"Info\">\r\n                                    <svg width=\"4\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 4 17\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 17H0V7H4V17Z\" />\r\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 4H0V0H4V4Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                </button>\r\n                                <button class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-button--close d-none\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n                                    \r\n<svg width=\"17\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <g id=\"plusExplore\">\r\n        <rect id=\"barH\" y=\"8\" width=\"17\" height=\"3\" />\r\n        <rect id=\"barV\" x=\"7\" y=\"11\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" transform=\"rotate(-90 7 11)\" />\r\n    </g>\r\n</svg>\r\n                                </button>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-text\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"umb-block-grid__layout-item\" data-content-element-type-alias=\"richTextEditor\" data-content-element-type-key=\"c1027a81-3465-402a-bde1-ed4090557084\" data-element-udi=\"umb://element/78d38927cb814e81875ec00122e254a3\" data-col-span=\"8\" data-row-span=\"1\" style=\" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 8; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; \">\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Doing it differently</strong></p>\n\n<p>A pioneering approach, involving the disassembly, transportation and storage of an existing structure, followed by its&nbsp;reassembly on site, was a first for Belgium, challenging conventional approaches to design and public tendering.</p>\n\n<p>An initial research phase in preparation for the competition saw Rotor identify four existing buildings with appropriate structures for the hall and 51N4E develop a &lsquo;loose-fit&rsquo; design that could be adapted to accommodate each of them. The skatepark aspect of the scheme was designed by Witteveen &amp; Bos for under the east side of the hall, helping to encourage the scheme&rsquo;s acceptance in the neighbourhood.</p>\n\n<p>Bruxelles-Propret&eacute; eventually settled on a former equestrian centre slated for demolition in the city of Li&egrave;ge, around 100km from Brussels. Its 26m-wide boomerang-shaped glulam timber arches were in a decent state of repair and would give the project a strong identity.</p>\n\n<p>In an unconventional move for a publicly-funded project, the client bought the hall from the owner before detailed design and had the frame carefully dismantled during demolition and stored in a warehouse in Nivelles, south of Brussels.</p>    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"umb-block-grid__layout-item\" data-content-element-type-alias=\"galleryBlock\" data-content-element-type-key=\"4840a772-2227-467d-8e08-80cf13434971\" data-element-udi=\"umb://element/98f15a16ff084d6fb9cf7d395f5d2f41\" data-col-span=\"8\" data-row-span=\"1\" style=\" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 8; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; \">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gallery-block block-background--black\" x-load x-ignore x-data=\"galleryBlock\">\r\n    <div class=\"gallery-block__swiper swiper\" x-ref=\"swiperEl\">\r\n        <div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-wrapper swiper-wrapper\" x-ref=\"swiperWrapper\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-slide swiper-slide\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-none slide-text-hidden\">\r\n        <div>\r\n            1 of 4\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"title--small\">\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    <img class=\"image-item slide-image-hidden\" src=\"/media/crgdcbxy/eeb65d7276b3ff4fd9571af3e1de02e0.jpg?format=webp&amp;autoorient=true\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" />\r\n            <div class=\"d-none slide-caption-hidden\">\r\n                Reused half-arches were bolted together in pairs to boost robustness. | Credit: Rotor\r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-slide swiper-slide\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-none slide-text-hidden\">\r\n        <div>\r\n            2 of 4\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"title--small\">\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    <img class=\"image-item slide-image-hidden\" src=\"/media/iu0edd3z/e65d468ef4d109eb265067172ce1b05f.jpg?format=webp&amp;autoorient=true\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" />\r\n            <div class=\"d-none slide-caption-hidden\">\r\n                The tops of the beams were removed, due to rot, and joined with steel connections. | Credit: Rotor\r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-slide swiper-slide\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-none slide-text-hidden\">\r\n        <div>\r\n            3 of 4\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"title--small\">\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    <img class=\"image-item slide-image-hidden\" src=\"/media/qkynf5jl/b7de099a49f4687e401c2b1f715c8e7f.jpg?format=webp&amp;autoorient=true\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" />\r\n            <div class=\"d-none slide-caption-hidden\">\r\n                Refixing the structure. | Credit: Rotor\r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-slide swiper-slide\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-none slide-text-hidden\">\r\n        <div>\r\n            4 of 4\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"title--small\">\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    <img class=\"image-item slide-image-hidden\" src=\"/media/45bnixdu/bcb7dbd723036360aacb65652bdc6822.jpg?format=webp&amp;autoorient=true\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" />\r\n            <div class=\"d-none slide-caption-hidden\">\r\n                Working on the structure. | Credit: Rotor\r\n            </div>\r\n</div>        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gallery-block__swiper-buttons\">\r\n            <button class=\"gallery-block__swiper-button--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">\r\n                \r\n<svg width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 41.8768L31.716 17.9292L7.94982 41.6954L1.05581 34.8014Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n            </button>\r\n            <button class=\"gallery-block__swiper-button--next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">\r\n                \r\n<svg width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 4