rg/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 41.8768L31.716 17.9292L7.94982 41.6954L1.05581 34.8014Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                        <button class=\"gallery-block__swiper-button--next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">\r\n                                            \r\n<svg width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <path id=\"arrow\" d=\"M1.05581 34.8014L24.822 11.0352L0.874388 11.0352L0.874389 0.875611H41.8756V41.8768L31.716 41.8768L31.716 17.9292L7.94982 41.6954L1.05581 34.8014Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar\" x-ref=\"modalSidebar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-buttons\">\r\n                                <button class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-button--info\" aria-label=\"Info\">\r\n                                    <svg width=\"4\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 4 17\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 17H0V7H4V17Z\" />\r\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 4H0V0H4V4Z\" />\r\n</svg>\r\n                                </button>\r\n                                <button class=\"gallery-block__modal-sidebar-button--close d-none\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n                                    \r\n<svg width=\"17\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"\">\r\n    <g id=\"plusExplore\">\r\n        <rect id=\"barH\" y=\"8\" width=\"17\" height=\"3\" />\r\n        <rect id=\"barV\" x=\"7\" y=\"11\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" transform=\"rotate(-90 7 11)\" />\r\n    </g>\r\n</svg>\r\n                                </button>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"gallery-block__modal-text\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"umb-block-grid__layout-item\" data-content-element-type-alias=\"richTextEditor\" data-content-element-type-key=\"c1027a81-3465-402a-bde1-ed4090557084\" data-element-udi=\"umb://element/97b4bb8cb8334e15a78be711ffda5721\" data-col-span=\"8\" data-row-span=\"1\" style=\" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 8; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; \">\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What next?</strong></p>\n\n<p>The main goal for the future, says Pineur, is to ensure that these individual initiatives work together to create a system, &lsquo;perhaps at the scale of a country&rsquo;, to deliver in sufficient volumes to support the design and delivery of buildings. Timing and storage issues must also be addressed, he adds, to ensure that a resource that is available today can be bought and made available to build when a project gets to site.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>On a positive note, Gueguen says the overall cost of choosing reused glulam on Recypark was equivalent or slightly cheaper than building the arches new, despite the additional overheads related to transport logistics, renting a storage facility, materials studies and testing etc.</p>\n\n<p>Recypark&rsquo;s approach has also changed the attitude of main contractor Eiffage, which now plans to incorporate multiple reused elements in the conversion of a historic synagogue into a dance school in Belgium.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&lsquo;The most important thing we learned is that we can build with materials from existing buildings, removing the need to fabricate new products,&rsquo; says Jos&eacute; Rangel, project manager&nbsp; at Eiffage. &lsquo;It&rsquo;s important to look for products set for demolition and give them a second life &hellip; you have to change your mindset and be convinced you will find what you need,&rsquo; he concludes.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"umb-block-grid__area\"\r\n     data-area-col-span=\"4\"\r\n     data-area-row-span=\"1\"\r\n     data-area-alias=\"area_1\"\r\n     style=\"--umb-block-grid--grid-columns: 4;--umb-block-grid--area-column-span: 4; --umb-block-grid--area-row-span: 1;\">\r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"umb-block-grid__layout-container\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"umb-block-grid__layout-item\" data-content-element-type-alias=\"mostPopular\" data-content-element-type-key=\"c43ac6a8-f42d-4f5e-88b9-d6f030866719\" data-element-udi=\"umb://element/c050fdf2f61c43eb86a482ad559c55d3\" data-col-span=\"4\" data-row-span=\"1\" style=\" --umb-block-grid--item-column-span: 4; --umb-block-grid--item-row-span: 1; \">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"most-popular-block\">\r\n    <div class=\"most-popular-block__headline\">Most popular</div>\r\n    <div class=\"most-popular-block__default-image\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <picture class=\"\">\r\n        <source srcSet=\"/media/jjfjvwjq/riba9711.jpg?width=100&amp;height=66&amp;format=webp&amp;autoorient=true&amp;v=1dc96b21f9c8a10\" media=\"(max-width: 991px)\" />\r\n        <source srcSet=\"/media/jjfjvwjq/riba9711.jpg?width=664&amp;height=466&amp;format=webp&amp;autoorient=true&amp;v=1dc96b21f9c8a10\" />\r\n        <img class=\"image-item\" src=\"/media/jjfjvwjq/riba9711.jpg?width=100&amp;height=66&amp;format=webp&amp;autoorient=true&amp;v=1dc96b21f9c8a10\" alt=\"A large modern courtyard made up of metal mesh pergolas and geometric roof shapes \" title=\"A large modern courtyard made up of metal mesh pergolas and geometric roof shapes \" />\r\n    </picture>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"most-popular-bloc